# Auto Deploy After Changes

When code or content changes are completed for this repo:

- Run the relevant verification commands before deploying, usually `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm build` from `artifacts/mands-site`.
- Commit the completed work with a concise message using a GitHub-recognized author email.
- Push `main` to GitHub so Vercel deploys automatically.
- Check the Vercel/GitHub deployment status and report whether it completed or was blocked.

Do not auto-push if the user explicitly asks to hold changes locally.
